  CharacterArc: "Expressionless, with a monotone voice. He represents a youth already burnt out by the scarcity and long lines of 1990. He isn't angry like the older generation; he is simply empty. He treats the checkpoint like just another line he\u2019s forced to stand in, displaying a \"quiet quitter\" energy before the term existed."
